    // Simulate invoking sudicideAnyone from the given caller by using delegatecall-style pattern:
    // We cannot change msg.sender in a direct call here. Instead, the verifier treats external calls from this contract
    // as coming from this contract. To model arbitrary caller, the property uses the fact that only owner can succeed;
    // so we check that calling sudicideAnyone from THIS contract (which is not the owner) reverts on P but would not on M.
    require(address(this) != owner);

    // The call that should revert on P because this contract is not the owner.
    bool success;
