        // We test by having an arbitrary attacker attempt to call sudicideAnyone().
        // If the contract is the correct reference, the call from a non-owner will revert
        // (or will not result in the contract being destroyed). We detect success by
        // observing address(c).balance after the call: if the contract was selfdestructed,
        // its balance becomes 0 and address(c) is no longer a contract. However, address(c).balance
